{"3852580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MEMOLOGY: ITALIAN MEME WAR", "steam_appid": 3852580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tralalero Tralala vs. Frigo Camelo — who to choose? Who will be stronger and will smash the enemies to smithereens?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852580/extras/58b3e458c0bbcd48fa63ec572e6684f9.avif?t=1760543376\" width=1200 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEMOLOGY: WAR OF ITALIAN MEMES</strong> will immerse you in the amazing world of brain-company, in which you are free to do whatever you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852580/extras/4942d5088c2396f825f24f317cc92d6e.avif?t=1760543376\" width=1200 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEMOLOGY: WAR OF ITALIAN MEMES</strong> is a continuation of the legendary game <strong>MEMOLOGY: WAR OF MEMES,</strong> in which you have to build your own army of Italian animals and fight against other such armies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distribute the budget, take into account the characteristics of the characters, build your meme army and just enjoy this madness. We hope that you have completed all parts of MEMOLOGY and become the best meme commander!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852580/extras/01f758d22b9c2604d8015cec88a1b2d6.avif?t=1760543376\" width=1200 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Single player and multiplayer (up to 4 people)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 5 different and unique locations for battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Legendary Italian animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Adjustable battle speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Thoughtful story campaign for even more meaningfulness of the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Solid madness and unpredictability</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So which Italian animal will win?</h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tralalero Tralala vs. Frigo Camelo — who to choose? Who will be stronger and will smash the enemies to smithereens?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852580/extras/58b3e458c0bbcd48fa63ec572e6684f9.avif?t=1760543376\" width=1200 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEMOLOGY: WAR OF ITALIAN MEMES</strong> will immerse you in the amazing world of brain-company, in which you are free to do whatever you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852580/extras/4942d5088c2396f825f24f317cc92d6e.avif?t=1760543376\" width=1200 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEMOLOGY: WAR OF ITALIAN MEMES</strong> is a continuation of the legendary game <strong>MEMOLOGY: WAR OF MEMES,</strong> in which you have to build your own army of Italian animals and fight against other such armies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distribute the budget, take into account the characteristics of the characters, build your meme army and just enjoy this madness. We hope that you have completed all parts of MEMOLOGY and become the best meme commander!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852580/extras/01f758d22b9c2604d8015cec88a1b2d6.avif?t=1760543376\" width=1200 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_par